              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 19,
                "start": 19
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Parker Rider-Longmaid, the injury claimed is the deprivation without due process of the liberty interest in proving innocence with newly discovered evidence."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Rider-Longmaid",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "fb711db546a54e09824c8d8940f362ec22731ff09585fe7709af2d63cdab9a92",
